      "content": "You're looking for a nuanced character, which is a rich area for storytelling. A Latino background could be used to explore themes of assimilation pressure or the desire for upward mobility within a system that might have historically excluded them. Perhaps the character feels the pressure to succeed rapidly to prove their worth in a predominantly white financial world. Their drive could stem from a deep-seated need to achieve a level of stability or respect that they feel their community or background hasn't afforded them.",
